      "message": "merge: upstream/main into issue/3326-face-start-exit - one pick rotation\n\nText conflicts, both additions kept:\n- mcp/tools.rs: the Face rule and the lathe (Z, X) sentence of #3331.\n- operation/pick_kinds.rs: Face `Raster`, Slot `Ends`, the turning\n  `Meridian` arms; the tilted Face and the tilted Slot refusals.\n- tests/start_exit_shared.rs: the Face, Slot and turning arms; the panic\n  text names the kinds that take a pick.\n\nHand edit (review of e07a88d09, item 1): `wcs_yaw::rotate_params` merged\nwithout a conflict but turned the Slot picks two times (the Slot arm of\n#3978 and the general rule of this branch). The pick loop of the Slot arm\nis removed; the one rule after the `match` turns each pick one time.\n\nRefs #3326\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
